  "source_text": "`include \"disciplines.vams\"\nmodule m(u,y,r); input u; output y; inout r; electrical u,y,r; real q; integer n; electrical h,e,nc; analog begin @(initial_step) begin q=0.2; n=0; end\n@(timer(1e-6,1e-6,1e-12)) begin q=V(u,r); n=n+1; end\nV(h,r)<+q; V(nc,r)<+n;\nV(e,r)<+transition(q,1e-7,2e-7,3e-7);\nV(y,r)<+laplace_nd(V(e,r),'{1},'{1,4e-7}); end endmodule",
